---
const naverStoreUrl = "https://smartstore.naver.com/";
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <!-- Left: brand -->
    <div class="brand-col">
      <h4 class="col-title">BIFI BLANCHE</h4>
      <p class="brand-desc">
        피부를 하나의 생태계로 바라봅니다.<br>
        순수한 균형, 자극지수 0.00의 원칙으로<br>
        당신의 피부 생태계를 지킵니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right cluster: 3 columns each with top border -->
    <div class="right-cluster">
      <div class="col">
        <h4 class="col-title">NAVIGATE</h4>
        <ul class="link-list">
          <li><a href="/">HOME</a></li>
          <li><a href="/brand">BRAND</a></li>
          <li><a href="/news">NEWS</a></li>
          <li><a href={naverStoreUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">NAVER STORE ↗</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="col">
        <h4 class="col-title">DELIVERY INFO</h4>
        <p style="line-height:1.4;">
          57, Seolleung-ro 130-gil,<br>
          Gangnam-gu, Seoul,<br>
          Korea
        </p>
        <p class="kr-addr">서울 강남구 선릉로130길 57</p>
      </div>

      <div class="col">
        <h4 class="col-title">CS CENTER</h4>
        <p><strong>TEL</strong> 02-3413-9017</p>
        <p><strong>OPEN</strong> 9:30am–5:30pm</p>
        <p><strong>BREAK</strong> 12:30pm–1:30pm</p>
        <p>SAT, SUN, HOLIDAY OFF</p>
        <div class="social">
